    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A detached four-bedroomed home for sale in a great location that`s close to town and all amenities is indeed a great opportunity when one arises, which is why we`re very excited at Michael Lavelle Estate Agents to be bringing number 11 Bohair Dara in Lis na Dara to the market.\n\nThis is a really, really impressive B-rated detached property that promises excellent accommodation in terms of space, proportion, and opportunity. Set within the lovely and very popular Lis na Dara development, this spacious home provides over 135 sq m of accommodation, including:\n\n- formal living room with fireplace\n- spacious open-plan kitchen/living/diner\n- four very spacious bedrooms with principle en-suite & great family bathroom \n- a very nicely presented back garden, which has a lovely sunny aspect and great structure thanks to patio and hard landscaping \n\nThe property is very convenient to schools and shops, and within walking distance not only of Dundalk train station but also of the town centre. It is now on the market at 470,000."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
